<attrib name="id" value="frnt-lt"></attrib></parentattributes>

<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to consolidate the Statutes relating to
the punishment for Piracy.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_aa68a5e9-909e-4b33-b734-846c23371128"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_2020c665-a21b-475b-abed-94dbfdaf1793"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref
refid="act-1902-069" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Piracy Punishment Act
1902</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_da2a4729-4c08-4c72-a1a2-f91fccb03ecb"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_cfad24aa-4d3e-4e0b-8629-230a61b02f63"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Repeals</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Act second Victoria number ten, so far as the
same adopts the Imperial Act first Victoria chapter eighty-eight is hereby
repealed, except as to offences committed and things done or commenced before
the passing of this Act, which shall be dealt with and continued, and in
respect of which every right and liability shall remain as if this Act had not
been passed.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1d3fa8f2-643c-4df3-9ae5-b6d8f27b6cd2"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_015185df-7f05-4f3c-931e-3f288c6abbb3"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Repeal of so much of certain Acts as relates to
punishment</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">So much of the Imperial Acts mentioned in the
Schedule hereto as relates to the punishment of the crime of piracy or of any
offence by any of the said Acts declared to be piracy or of accessories
thereto, is hereby repealed.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e4a4d4ea-e3c5-468f-b993-7c0b9ad84f4a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_8f6ea7b4-5b80-4028-b146-121912effceb"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Punishment where piracy accompanied by assault with intent to
murder etc</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Whosoever with intent to commit, or at the time
of, or immediately before, or immediately after, committing the crime of
piracy, in respect of any ship or vessel, assaults with intent to murder any
person being on board of or belonging to such ship or vessel, or</txt>
<list unnumbered.indent="1" number.type="default">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c79a315e-f905-4fdd-a94b-8cd4f31cbffd" id="sec.4-para1">
<block><txt break.before="1">stabs, cuts, or wounds any such person, or
unlawfully does any act by which the life of any such person may be
endangered</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">shall be liable to penal servitude for
life.</txt></block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 4:</b> Am 1985 No 59,
Sch 1.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ce17e931-3a9c-45fa-8900-cd447366a0f1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_0174b4b6-2ecd-44ad-bcea-da78b028cdb1"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Punishment in other cases</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Whosoever commits any offence which by any of the
Imperial Acts mentioned in the Schedule hereto amounts to the crime of piracy
and is thereby made punishable with death, shall be liable to penal servitude
for life or for any term of years not less than fifteen or to imprisonment for
any term not exceeding three years.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a8586780-2847-4dd4-9ddd-d2de4e5e1e5f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_f0bfc6f8-05e6-40f6-a79d-f9d779a6763f"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Punishment of accessories</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In the case of every felony punishable under this
Act:</txt>
<list unnumbered.indent="1" number.type="default">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3917193c-fd3e-4755-b8a2-dcc91afc6741" id="sec.6-para1">
<block><txt break.before="1">every principal in the second degree, and every
accessory before the fact shall be punishable in the same manner as the
principal in the first degree is by this Act punishable,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_bd005780-0d9f-4b5f-bb4b-77e2f8874452" id="sec.6-para1-oc.2">
<block><txt break.before="1">every accessory after the fact shall be liable to
imprisonment for any term not exceeding two years.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 6:</b> Am 1985 No 59,
Sch 1.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3366ac7d-3a98-4f53-9caa-4b66a970625a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_af0f34ec-ebd9-4ef0-936c-871fe5564093"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Where persons may be sentenced to imprisonment, hard labour
or solitary confinement may be ordered</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Where any person is convicted of an offence
punishable under this Act for which imprisonment may be awarded, the
Court</txt>
<list unnumbered.indent="1" number.type="default">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c6580200-38fb-461c-a976-6ce6959de0f5" id="sec.7-para1">
<block><txt break.before="1">may sentence the person to be imprisoned, or
imprisoned and kept to hard labour in the common gaol or house of correction,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_8620acc5-e38e-465e-beb1-0b1b7a642840" id="sec.7-para1-oc.2">
<block><txt break.before="1">may direct that the person be kept in solitary
confinement for any portion or portions of such imprisonment or imprisonment
with hard labour not exceeding one month at any one time, and not exceeding
three months in any one year.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e011a008-ab7c-4d84-b0de-f72df76a9ff3"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_8e5fc20c-fc89-4ab5-9cd1-5628ed8983bb"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Nothing herein to affect Acts regulating management of
prisons</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Nothing in this Act shall affect the provisions
of any Act relating to the management and control of
prisons.</txt></block></level>
</content>


